# line-view — шаги записи (что показывается — line-view.md)
# Нажатий нет: этап — заход в настройки и смена контрола, после выхода — заметка в новом виде.
# Его замечание 2026-10-05: Stripe — в самом конце, вместе со сменой его opacity (раньше он перекрывал показ Block opacity).
title Line view | Tune how tags and Blocks look on the line
open Line view.md
caret ## This week
stage Default look
say Default: tags, dates and links at full strength
pause 2800

stage Tag bubble corners
say Tag bubble corners → 100
settings Visual
set Tag bubble corners = 100
say Tag bubbles turn square
pause 2600

stage Block text size
say Block text size → 70%
settings Visual
set Left Block text size = 70
set Right Block text size = 70
say Both Blocks get smaller, your text stays
pause 2600

stage Block opacity
say Block opacity → 40%
settings Visual
set Opacity of the Left Block = 40
set Opacity of the Right Block = 40
say Both Blocks fade, your text stands out
pause 2600

stage Stripe
say Color the Block with Stripe → on
settings Visual
set Color the Block with Stripe = on
say A faint Stripe runs behind each Block
pause 2600

stage Stripe opacity
say Stripe opacity → 45
settings Visual
set Stripe opacity = 45
say The Stripe gets stronger
pause 3000
